{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月から\n『沈黙の金曜日』のアシスタントを\nやらせていただけることが発表されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！！！\n本当に嬉しい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈金のらりんの後任は\nアンダーメンバーがやるだろうってところまでは聞いてたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんの取り柄もない自分にくるわけない\nって思ってた所もあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初聞いたときは\nめっちゃびっくりしたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田推しのみなさんが\nもっと中田を見れる機会が増えないかなー\nと思っていたのを知ってるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと嬉しい報告ができて\n良かったなと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/26/6572327/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週、中田を\nFM-FUJIで聴けて\nUstreamで見れて\nSTUDIO ViViDで会えますよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、よろしくね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/26/6572327/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/26/6572327/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B.L.T.絶賛発売中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『STREETJACK5月号』\n本日発売日です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの人気の連載\n『Hello me』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の番が回ってきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は中田\nまだ見てないのでドキドキです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/26/6572327/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"typ